s.length > 0) {\n  console.log('법인 목록:', corps);\n}\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\import_company_database_list","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking business types","toolSummary":"Check biz types of 200 rows"}}]}
